les before they are saved.'=>'Skrip, pautan dan rujukan luaran dialih keluar daripada fail SVG yang dimuat naik sebelum ia disimpan.','My uploads'=>'Muat naik saya','Align items'=>'Jajarkan item','Stretch'=>'Regangkan','Baseline'=>'Garis dasar','Align self'=>'Jajarkan kendiri','Auto'=>'Auto','Aspect ratio'=>'Nisbah aspek','Background colour'=>'Warna latar belakang','Box shadow'=>'Bayang kotak','Column span'=>'Rentang lajur','Text colour'=>'Warna teks','Cursor'=>'Kursor','Pointer'=>'Penunjuk','Move'=>'Alih','Grab'=>'Ambil','Not allowed'=>'Tidak dibenarkan','Crosshair'=>'Rerambut silang','Zoom in'=>'Zum masuk','Block'=>'Sekat','Inline'=>'Sebaris','Inline block'=>'Blok sebaris','Inline flexbox'=>'Flexbox sebaris','Inline grid'=>'Grid sebaris','Contents only'=>'Kandungan sahaja','Hidden'=>'Tersembunyi','Basis'=>'Asas','Row reversed'=>'Baris diterbalikkan','Column'=>'Lajur','Column reversed'=>'Lajur diterbalikkan','Grow'=>'Kembangkan','Shrink'=>'Kecilkan','Wrap'=>'Balut','No wrap'=>'Jangan balut','Wrap reversed'=>'Balut terbalik','Font'=>'Fon','Italic'=>'Italik','Weight'=>'Pemberat','Thin (100)'=>'Nipis (100)','Extra light (200)'=>'Sangat nipis (200)','Light (300)'=>'Ringan (300)','Regular (400)'=>'Biasa (400)','Medium (500)'=>'Sederhana (500)','Semi bold (600)'=>'Separuh tebal (600)','Bold (700)'=>'Tebal (700)','Extra bold (800)'=>'Sangat tebal (800)','Black (900)'=>'Hitam (900)','Gap'=>'Jurang','Area name'=>'Nama kawasan','Named areas'=>'Kawasan dinamakan','Offsets'=>'Ofset','Justify content'=>'Wajarkan kandungan','Space between'=>'Jarak antara','Space around'=>'Ruang di sekeliling','Space evenly'=>'Jarakkan sama rata','Letter spacing'=>'Jarak huruf','Line height'=>'Ketinggian baris','Margin'=>'Margin','Max height'=>'Ketinggian maksimum','Max width'=>'Lebar maksimum','Min height'=>'Ketinggian minimum','Min width'=>'Lebar minimum','Overflow'=>'Limpahan','Visible'=>'Kelihatan','Clip'=>'Klip','Scroll when needed'=>'Skrol apabila diperlukan','Always scroll'=>'Sentiasa tata